WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:08.400 line:80% align:center
I believe we are on this planet to enjoy
deep connection with other people, not
the fragments an algorithm pushes at us.

2
00:08.900 --> 00:11.200 line:80% align:center
My name is Qiqi. I started MindYoga.

3
00:11.800 --> 00:21.900 line:80% align:center
This time I took nine strangers from
across the country into the mist of
Tiantai Mountain. Three days, two
nights, one simple-looking question:
what is regret?

4
00:21.900 --> 00:30.800 line:80% align:center
In a fast world, we forget the electric
realness of eye contact and lose the
courage to sit in silence with
ourselves.

5
00:31.500 --> 00:40.700 line:80% align:center
Here, a dialogue built on a
philosophical frame breaks our fixed
ways of seeing, lets ideas collide and
rebuilds the ability to think deeply.

6
00:41.100 --> 00:50.400 line:80% align:center
When you set your own colours aside and
really talk, you walk in their shoes and
build a bridge to what is underneath.

7
00:50.400 --> 00:59.500 line:80% align:center
I never ask people to introduce their
background. Titles and labels come off;
what is left is the joy of thinking and
connecting.

8
00:59.800 --> 01:04.700 line:80% align:center
At the end we look for some common
ground, though philosophical questions
never get a final answer.

9
01:05.000 --> 01:16.400 line:80% align:center
What matters is that along the way you
notice habits of thought you never saw,
open a new dimension of dialogue with
the world, and see what different lives
can spark in each other.

10
01:16.900 --> 01:20.400 line:80% align:center
Here we are like a flock of free birds
flying into each other's conversations.

11
01:20.400 --> 01:29.400 line:80% align:center
There are no right answers here. I want
a safe space where people of different
backgrounds speak honestly and leave
inspired and warmed.

12
01:30.100 --> 01:35.300 line:80% align:center
A search for yourself. A collision of
minds. A resonance of souls.
